                <section class="formation-reference-section formation-faq-section scroll-reveal reveal-up">
                    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                    <details open><summary>How can a company registration consultant help with incorporation?</summary><p>A professional consultant can assist with selecting an appropriate business structure, incorporation documentation, name-related formalities, constitutional documents and applicable regulatory procedures. Professional guidance can also help founders understand the corporate requirements that follow incorporation.</p></details>
                    <details><summary>What documents are generally required to register a private limited company?</summary><p>The documentation depends on the proposed company and its directors and shareholders. Common requirements may include identity and address proofs, photographs, registered-office documents and incorporation declarations. Additional documents may be required depending on the circumstances.</p></details>
                    <details><summary>Do you provide Foreign Company Registration Services?</summary><p>Yes. We assist foreign companies and international promoters with establishing an appropriate business presence in India, including subsidiaries, wholly owned subsidiaries, joint ventures, collaborations and applicable branch, liaison or project-office structures.</p></details>
                    <details><summary>Can you help choose between a Private Limited Company, LLP, Partnership Firm or Proprietorship?</summary><p>Yes. We can compare these structures based on ownership, liability, compliance requirements, taxation, investment plans, business activities and future growth objectives.</p></details>
